6.3 Evaluation of normality

6.3.1 Control group


Code
normSim |&gt;
  gather(samp, data, -trt) |&gt;
  filter(trt == "control") |&gt;
  ggplot(aes(sample = data)) +
  geom_qq() +
  geom_qq_line() +
  facet_wrap(~samp)











